{
  "schema": "outshine/render-oracle-manifest",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "render/materials/a-beautiful-game",
  "title": "Khronos ABeautifulGame -- 49 drawn parts over 15 materials and 33 images, which is the draw list at scale",
  "covers": [
    "I.26",
    "I.26.10",
    "I.26.12",
    "khronos:ABeautifulGame"
  ],
  "criterion": {
    "kind": "self-describing",
    "oracleRole": "reference",
    "says": "Chess set using transmission and volume. ... The geometry is separated into individual meshes (instanced where possible), meaning this version of the model could be used to create a fully interactive chess game with individually movable pieces.",
    "statedAt": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-Assets/2bac6f8c57bf471df0d2a1e8a8ec023c7801dddf/Models/ABeautifulGame/README.md",
    "note": "board:0087 names this subject among the ones whose oracle CANNOT be reduced -- a whole material stack with transmission and volume is not a closed form -- so this case claims nothing about the material. WHAT IT DOES CLAIM IS THE LIST: 49 parts, 15 surface slots, 934309 vertices and 1500224 triangles through one stage, with the placement scored exactly and the picture judged by eye. `KHR_materials_transmission` and `KHR_materials_volume` are used by the file and read by neither side here: the oracle's closure is replaced with an emitter and ours has no transmission, so the eight pawn tops render as their base colour on both sides rather than as glass. That is stated because it is what the picture shows."
  },
  "subjectClass": "sub-pixel-present",
  "acceptanceClass": {
    "is": "general-position",
    "because": "A fronto-parallel planar placement owns three continuous freedoms -- two of aim and one of scale -- and every distinct silhouette line costs one condition, so 2 + k >= E is what decides whether the construction can be written at all (`board/`). A chess set of 1.5 million triangles whose silhouette resolves into tens of thousands of distinct lines. The construction is not merely unbuilt here, it is unwritable."
  },
  "subjects": [
    {
      "id": "a-beautiful-game",
      "kind": "gltf",
      "name": "ABeautifulGame",
