        "TEXCOORD_0"
      ],
      "notes": "49 mesh-bearing nodes over 15 meshes -- the pieces are instanced, so one mesh is referenced by eight nodes -- naming 15 materials and 33 images, 11 of them base colour and 22 normal and occlusion-roughness-metallic maps this engine does not consume. Two materials carry no image at all (the pawn tops, which the file makes glass through KHR_materials_transmission).",
